ialCatechism</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SharranCloister_MartialCatechism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SharranCloister_MartialCatechism\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">a00d11ab-07ea-47b0-9081-6ab3b92ad8fb</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a00d11ab-07ea-47b0-9081-6ab3b92ad8fb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a00d11ab-07ea-47b0-9081-6ab3b92ad8fb\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a table in the main chamber of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloister_of_Sombre_Embrace\" title=\"Cloister of Sombre Embrace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloister of Sombre Embrace\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cloister_of_Sombre_Embrace\" title=\"Cloister of Sombre Embrace\">Cloister of Sombre Embrace</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Strengthening of the Sword Arm. \n</p><p>Melee drills for two hours each day. Change opponents and weaponry for each round. Bloodletting is acceptable - indeed, it is expected. Remember - a well-trained warrior has the scars to prove it. \n</p><p><br>\nHoning of the Archer's Eye. \n</p><p>Ranged drills for two hours each day. Targets will progress from fixed, to moving, to live. \n</p><p><br>\nHardening of the Poisoner's Heart. \n</p><p>Crafting and theory of poisons and concoctions, for two hours each day. Pupils shall be dosed with low levels of poisonous substances in order to develop their tolerance.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234824\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2002/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34108/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9848/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935089/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.879      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   49.879      1 -total\n 67.54%   33.688      9 Template:Icon_text\n 61.15%   30.503     21 Template:Trim\n 29.94%   14.936      1 Template:PageSeo\n 29.73%   14.828      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 27.16%   13.548      4 Template:Icon_link\n 22.73%   11.339      2 Template:Uid\n 19.96%    9.956      9 